  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "She sits beside Qin Juan outside the stage and asks why Qin Juan called the exchange close, having seen Feng Jin Huang use two refinement path killer moves in a row. Qin Juan names her junior sister and explains that the match is a martial duel. She purses her lips at the idea of being disturbed while refining Gu. She privately calls Fang Yuan a demon with the other Spirit Affinity House disciples, cries out in loathing when she thinks he has already attacked, and opens her mouth in shock when Qin Juan explains Feng Jin Huang’s trap. Qin Juan tells her she has just begun her cultivation journey.",
      "chapters": [
        854
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_juan",
        "char_feng_jin_huang",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_spirit_affinity_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She has a small, chubby mouth.",
      "chapters": [
        854
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She runs to Feng Jin Huang’s accommodations with a chubby face and a flustered look to warn that Zhao Lian Yun is coming. Qin Juan reminds her she is an elite disciple and should not be so panicky. She gasps when Zhao Lian Yun kneels and begs Feng Jin Huang to save Ma Hong Yun.",
      "chapters": [
        1191
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "warning-and-loyalty",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhao_lian_yun",
        "char_ma_hong_yun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On the road afterward she calls Zhao Lian Yun pitiful and kind, then tells Qin Juan she has no intention of siding against Feng Jin Huang: whatever Feng Jin Huang decides, she will support her.",
      "chapters": [
        1192
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "warning-and-loyalty",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spirit Affinity House puts her name on the list it sends after Li Jun Ying and Xu Hao block Feng Jin Huang, and Heavenly Court approves that House list quickly. She meets Feng Jin Huang outside Quiet Rain Valley with a cute and round face, anxious, and says she did not want to snatch the opportunity. Feng Jin Huang nudges her forehead and tells her to seize it. Qin Juan and she have always followed behind Feng Jin Huang as good friends. She jumps around cheering when Feng Jin Huang offers them guidance.",
      "chapters": [
        1971
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "house-nomination",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_li_jun_ying",
        "char_xu_hao",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "res_quiet_rain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a Spirit Affinity House Gu Master chosen as a Gu Immortal seed. The sect’s original nominee was Feng Jin Huang; after Feng Jiu Ge’s betrayal the sect changed the nominee and she took that position. Spirit Affinity House only told her the background of the painting before sending her in. She shouts in amazement at the painting world, a young lady with eyes wide open and shining, buys candy, watches opera and street acts, then meets Chen Da Jiang of Wind Cloud Manor. She had been a follower of Feng Jin Huang when Chen Da Jiang first gained fame. She overflows with sympathy for painted beggars, stays to help them with Chen Da Jiang instead of following Xiao Qi Xing to the military camp, and greets him as Spirit Affinity House’s Sun Yao. Shen Shang judges that she and Chen Da Jiang, still acting by their nature after learning some inside story, will benefit greatly if they continue.",
      "chapters": [
        1992
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "painting-world",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "char_chen_da_jiang",
        "house_wind_cloud_manor",
        "char_xiao_qi_xing",
        "char_shen_shang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When divine bean soldiers kill the beggars on the street she first entered, her eyes are red and she says she will take revenge for those pitiful people.",
      "chapters": [
        2011
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "vow-to-avenge-the-beggars",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the street fight, three female dancers move around her and weaken the soldiers with long sleeves. She also holds the human path killer move Joy in Helping People, which strengthens her allies.",
      "chapters": [
        2012
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "street-fighting",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_joy_in_helping_people"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Xiao Qi Xing at the front, she appears with Fairy Bi Xia, Sun Yuan Hua, Ying Sheng Ji, Chen Da Jiang, and the rest. Shen Shang names that group the ten children of human path, Gu Immortal seeds Heavenly Court is cultivating from Central Continent’s ten great ancient sects.",
      "chapters": [
        2065
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "painting-world-fame",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_bi_xia",
        "char_sun_yuan_hua",
        "char_ying_sheng_ji",
        "fac_ten_great_ancient_sects"
      ]
    }
  ],
